## Assumptions & Limitations

- This is a hypothetical academic analysis and was not commissioned by Amazon.
- Population and demographic characteristics serve as proxies for actual customer demand.
- The model uses simplified travel distances and assumed drone operating speeds.
- Demand allocation results are model estimates rather than observed market shares.
- Real-world implementation would require additional cost, regulatory, weather and operational feasibility analysis.



